  "model_answer_template": "R03: support for FY 2026-27 was billed and paid in advance; no service has been transferred, so it is a contract liability (para 106), not revenue (para 31). R07: a second invoice for the same PO 7781 milestone; reverse it. R09: the customer is owed a March service credit of 15% of ₹9,60,000 = ₹1,44,000; reduce revenue (paras 50-51) and raise the credit note. R10: the customer could use the licence only from 6 April 2026, so the revenue belongs to FY 2026-27 (para B61). R04, R08 and R11 look unusual but are supported by the log. Net adjustment to FY 2025-26 revenue: ₹{net_revenue_adjustment}.",
  "pass_threshold": 0.75,
  "template_version": "0.1.0"
